<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Duquesne, Pa..</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Duquesne, Pa..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>RRZ Public Markets, Inc said it priced 6.255 milllion of Duquesne, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series of 1997 with a top yield off 7.70 percent in 2022.</p>
